LICH-008 Seed Corpus: Wotan Ring Buffer / Cache

Operation sequences (bytes, mod 4):
  0 = Push   1 = Get   2 = Query   3 = Count

Focus areas:
  - Capacity boundary behavior (fill to N, push N+1)
  - Interleaved read/write patterns
  - Query filter edge cases (empty strings, case sensitivity)
  - Wrapping behavior verification
